sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant API as WalletController
    participant WS as WalletService
    participant DB as ApplicationDbContext

    C->>API: POST /api/wallet/deposit {amount}
    Note over API: [Authorize] validates JWT before controller

    alt amount <= 0 or missing
        API-->>C: 400 BadRequest {message}
    else valid amount
        API->>API: Extract userId from claims (NameIdentifier or sub)
        alt missing/invalid userId
            API-->>C: 401 Unauthorized {message}
        else userId ok
            API->>WS: DepositAsync(userId, amount)
            WS->>DB: Load wallet by userId
            alt wallet missing
                WS->>DB: Create wallet (Balance=0)
            end
            WS->>DB: wallet.Balance += amount
            WS->>DB: SaveChanges
            WS->>DB: Check low-balance alerts + write notifications (best-effort)
            WS-->>API: true
            API-->>C: 200 OK {message:"Deposit successful.", amount}
        end
    end
